# TypeScript + React

- Functional components, named exports for viz pieces, default export only for `App`.
- Keep trainer snapshots as plain data (`number`, arrays, small objects).
- Do not hide network math inside React state updaters.
- Colocate styles with the lab. No CSS-in-JS library unless a change says so.
